        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Set in Chicago, where a central network of computers connects everyone and everything, Watch Dogs explores the impact of technology within our society. Using the city as your weapon, you will embark on a personal mission to inflict your own brand of justice. Chicago's overarching network is known as the Central Operating System (ctOS), and it controls almost all of the city's technology and information - including key data on all of the city's residents.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Ambientado en Chicago, donde una red central de computadoras conecta a todos y a todo, Watch Dogs explora el impacto de la tecnología en nuestra sociedad. Usando la ciudad como arma, emprenderás una misión personal para impartir tu propia forma de justicia. La red general de Chicago se conoce como Sistema Operativo Central (ctOS), y controla casi toda la tecnología e información de la ciudad, incluidos datos clave sobre todos sus residentes.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
